'' The emitted name of an aliased procedure. See the source for what each line measures.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-mangle tests/mangle/src/alias-names.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' An alias on the DECLARE, carried to the definition -- this was 'PLAIN'.
'' EXPECT-OUT: myPlainName
'' OVERLOAD mangles around it rather than replacing it.
'' EXPECT-OUT: _Z10lower_caseu7INTEGER
'' EXPECT-OUT: fx_c
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1T12myMemberNameEv
'' An aliased PROPERTY takes the alias alone: no '__get__', and the same symbol as the
'' method it aliases -- this was '_ZN3UDT11getv__get__Ev', declared with no receiver and
'' called with one.
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN3UDT4getvEv
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN3UDT4setvEu7INTEGER
'' EXPECT-NOT: __get__
'' EXPECT-NOT: __set__
'' GOLDEN: expected/alias-names.out
